      "text": "worship Christ with all your might, 2 Ne. 25:29. by laboring with their might, the Lord’s servants would not have people’s blood on their garments, Jacob 1:19. call servants, that we may labor diligently with our might in vineyard, Jacob 5:61, 71. Nephites fortify against Lamanites with all their might, trusting in God, Jacob 7:25. Benjamin has served his people with all might, Mosiah 2:11. the Son comes in his might, Alma 5:50. Nephites exert themselves in their might to do according to words of Lachoneus1, 3 Ne. 3:16. love God with all might, mind, and strength, Moro. 10:32.",
